{"id":"f0bd129c-9251-4047-b00c-cccb49848b30","programme":{"en":"<p class=\"indent0\"><i class=\"fa fa-caret-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Letters from the President of the General Assembly, dated 6 October 2026, 7 October 2026 and 8 October 2026, were sent to all permanent representatives and permanent observers.</p><p class=\"indent0\"><i class=\"fa fa-caret-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Delegations wishing to inscribe on the list of speakers are requested to do so through the e-deleGATE portal.</p><p class=\"indent0\"><i class=\"fa fa-caret-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> For the full programme of work of the plenary, please click on the &ldquo;Online schedule&rdquo; of meetings link below.</p>"},"agenda":{"en":"<p class=\"indent0\"><i class=\"fa fa-caret-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Scale of assessments for the apportionment of the expenses of the United Nations - Item 142: Report of the Fifth Committee (<a href='https://docs.un.org/en/A/81/387?direct=true' target='_blank'>A/81/387</a>)</p><p class=\"indent0\"><i class=\"fa fa-caret-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> From the New Partnership for Africa’s Development to Agenda 2063: progress in the implementation of sustainable development in Africa and international support - Item 64</p><p class='indent2'><i class=\"fa fa-circle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> From the New Partnership for Africa’s Development to Agenda 2063: progress in the implementation of sustainable development in Africa and international support - Item 64 (a)</p><p class='indent2'><i class=\"fa fa-circle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Causes of conflict and the promotion of durable peace and sustainable development in Africa - Item 64 (b)</p><p class='indent3'><i class=\"fa fa-circle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Reports of the Secretary-General (<a href='https://docs.un.org/en/A/81/297?direct=true' target='_blank'>A/81/297</a>, <a href='https://docs.un.org/en/A/81/298?direct=true' target='_blank'>A/81/298</a>, <a href='https://docs.un.